OL,3,GNEWSAHospital hopes pressure will ease
OL,4,Awithin 48 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief nurse of a Kent hospital
OL,7,Fwhich declared a critical incident
OL,8,Fsaying all its beds were occupied says
OL,9,Fit is hoped pressures will ease in the
OL,10,Fnext 24 to 48 hours.
OL,12,FEast Kent Hospitals NHS declared a
OL,13,Fcritical incident on Monday and warned
OL,14,Fanyone going to the William Harvey
OL,15,FHospital, in Ashford, to be ready for
OL,16,Fan "extremely long wait".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
