OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHospital hopes pressure will ease
OL,4,Awithin 48 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Kent, Sarah
OL,7,FHayes, chief nursing and midwifery
OL,8,Fofficer, said demand had increased over
OL,9,Fthe past few days and the trust was
OL,10,Fbeginning to see some patients with flu
OL,11,Fand other seasonal infections.
OL,13,FShe said all beds were occupied by
OL,14,Fpatients who needed care and emergency
OL,15,Fdepartments were seeing more people
OL,16,Farriving for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
